, "language": "english", "review": "Duck shooting game. Best game I have played recently.", "timestamp_created": 1771696242, "timestamp_updated": 1771696242, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218875401", "author": {"steamid": "76561198073414804", "personaname": "Mongol", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198073414804/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 415, "playtime_forever": 774, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 774, "last_played": 1771690490, "avatar": "6d74ac2da795305043bdd63a381cef0d3129230d"}, "language": "english", "review": "Escape from Duckov\r\n\r\nThis is a good good extraction shooter, albeit far too easy even on hard difficulties. You are this rambo duck and you kill other ducks, gather their loot and extract. You have a base in which you mostly want to expand your storage for all the junk you find. \r\n\r\nI mean it's all standard stuff but gets old real quick because of how easy it is...if you want to challenge yourself try Zero Sievert instead, now that one will make you sweat.", "timestamp_created": 1771690748, "timestamp_updated": 1771690748, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "218865348", "author": {"steamid": "76561199013263522", "personaname": "randotre", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199013263522/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 11, "playtime_forever": 1419, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 410, "last_played": 1789098252, "avatar": "20e4d8c68c73f4ee65cf50b9a74535cec556de28"}, "language": "english", "review": "it's extremely solid gameplay with a silly atmosphere and the multiple difficulties makes it customizable to be a perfect after work game. Quests are well done grind isn't bad and the sound design is awesome\r\n10/10 will be escaping from duckov again", "timestamp_created": 1771682808, "timestamp_updated": 1771682808, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1760598013", "reactions": []}]}